      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, In New York City alone over fifteen million dollars have been spent on surveying and designing fallout shelters and the Federal Government is prepared to give the City a total of thirty-one million dollars in shelter supplies; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
